Package: cic
Title: Personal Utilities for Single-Cell Data Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Cicada", email = "cicada_7x@163.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of personal utilities for single-cell sequencing
    data analysis. Provides a common output-path policy, output logging, and
    convenient plot export with protection against accidental file overwrites.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
